    "house_plan": "Plan (JSON)",
    "house_plan_help": "Floor plan in meters (x to the right, y downwards), floors from bottom to top. Empty = the example house. Example: {\"floors\":[{\"id\":\"gf\",\"name\":\"Ground floor\",\"short\":\"GF\",\"h\":2.7,\"foot\":[[0,0],[10,0],[10,8],[0,8]],\"rooms\":[{\"id\":\"living\",\"name\":\"Living room\",\"p\":[[0,0],[6,0],[6,5],[0,5]],\"accent\":\"home\"},{\"id\":\"stairs\",\"name\":\"Stairs\",\"kind\":\"stairs\",\"p\":[[6,0],[7,0],[7,3],[6,3]]}]}],\"roof\":{\"base\":\"gf\",\"pitch\":35,\"ridge\":\"x\",\"knee\":1}}. h = storey height, foot = outline of the floor, p = corners of a room, kind = room | outside | stairs, accent = home, grid, sun, heat, cool, ok … or #rrggbb, \"attic\":true for a floor under the roof, \"roof\" is optional. Write {\" without a space between { and \".",
    "house_devices": "Devices (JSON)",
    "house_devices_help": "List of devices. Example: [{\"id\":\"l1\",\"type\":\"light\",\"room\":\"living\",\"uv\":[0.5,0.5],\"oid\":\"0_userdata.0.living.light\",\"label\":\"Ceiling light\"},{\"id\":\"t1\",\"type\":\"thermostat\",\"room\":\"living\",\"uv\":[0.1,0.9],\"oid\":\"0_userdata.0.living.temp\",\"oidSet\":\"0_userdata.0.living.setpoint\"}]. type = light | plug | motion | window | thermostat | temperature | shutter. Position: uv = [0…1, 0…1] inside the room (0,0 = top left corner of the room) or at = [x, y] in meters together with \"floor\". oid = state that is shown; oidSet = state that lights and plugs write (default: oid) or the setpoint of a thermostat. Optional: floor, label, unit, dec, icon, accent. Tapping a light or plug switches it. Empty = demo devices of the example house.",
